
Explore the distinction between:

```text
TIME AS A LINE

PAST ───────── PRESENT ───────── FUTURE
```

and:

```text
TIME AS A STRUCTURE

        FUTURE
          ↑
          |
PAST ─── EVENT ─── POSSIBILITY
          |
          ↓
       MEMORY
```

the metaphor of a coordinate system.

Instead of:

```text
PAST → PRESENT → FUTURE
```

consider:

```text
             POSSIBILITY
                  ↑
                  |
MEMORY ←──── PRESENT ────→ ACTION
                  |
                  ↓
             CONSTRAINT
```

Example:

```text
                 FUTURE STATE A
                /
PRESENT ───────●────── FUTURE STATE B
                \
                 \
                  FUTURE STATE C
```

